+# Early morning study brief patch — 2026-10-07
+
+## What changed
+
+- Daily Telegram digest default moved from `08:00` to `06:00` in each user's profile timezone.
+- The first line of the briefing now highlights the first class of the day:
+  - `🚨 Первая пара: 10:00 — DBMS · C1.2.223 · через 4 ч`
+  - or `🎓 Сегодня пар нет` when the schedule is empty.
+- The rest of the briefing still includes today's tasks, the full timetable, and deadlines for the next 7 days.
+- Added `scripts/set-daily-digest-time.sh` to update an already-created worker `.env` and restart the systemd worker.
+
+## Apply on the server
+
+After applying the patch, run:
+
+```bash
+cd /home/zalewko/lifeos
+./scripts/set-daily-digest-time.sh 06:00
+```
+
+For 05:00 instead:
+
+```bash
+./scripts/set-daily-digest-time.sh 05:00
+```
+
+This helper matters when the existing `.env` still contains the old `DAILY_DIGEST_TIME=08:00`, because environment configuration overrides the code default.
